    "summary": "Added the subsystem store module (src/db/subsystems.ts). writeSubsystems replaces a repository's set in one transaction, stamped with the generation; an id already stored keeps its summary. readSubsystems reads a repository's set, or the subsystems holding the given files. The 'subsystem' and 'subsystem_by_file' databases are opened with the store, listed as structural so sessions can read them, and come with MIGRATION_V7_TO_V8 (SCHEMA_VERSION 8). Tests that pinned schema 7 and the 37-database count now say 8 and 39.",
